Package: iconlibutils
Architecture: all
Depends:
    python3,
    python3-inflect,
    wordnet-base,
    ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: themestylebrowser, python3-faiss, python3-pil, librsvg2-bin
Description: search and manage icons from installed icon libraries
 iconlibutils provides the iconlib command to search, inspect, pull, and
 browse icons from libraries such as tabler-icons, streamline-vectors, and
 heroicons. findicon is a shortcut for iconlib search. Library discovery
 uses /usr/share/iconlibutils/library/*/library.conf (and optional legacy
 path files). Plain-English search uses offline WordNet (wordnet-base) and
 python3-inflect. Optional FAISS indexing (-F) needs python3-faiss,
 python3-pil, librsvg2-bin, and CLIP via torch/transformers.
